 ## Quick start
 
 Run Freebuff in any project from your terminal:
 
 ```bash
 npm install -g freebuff
 cd ~/my-project
 freebuff
 ```
 
 Then describe what you want. Freebuff finds the relevant files, makes changes, and runs the checks that matter for your project.
 
